<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN THE SPANISH LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN THE SPANISH LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the</p>
<p>Spanish league championship after Sunday's games:</p>
<p>34 - Ronaldo (Barcelona)</p>
<p>25 - Alfonso Perez (Betis)</p>
<p>24 - Davor Suker (Real Madrid)</p>
<p>21 - Rivaldo (Deportivo Coruna), Raul Gonzalez (Real Madrid)</p>
<p>20 - Oli Alvarez (Oviedo)</p>
<p>17 - Jose Ziganda (Athletic Bilbao), Christopher Ohen</p>
<p>(Compostela), Luis Enrique Martinez (Barcelona)</p>
<p>16 - Ismael Urzaiz (Athletic Bilbao), Victor Fernandez</p>
<p>(Valladolid), Juan Eduardo Esnaider (Atletico Madrid)</p>
<p>15 - Fernando Morientes (Zaragoza)</p>
</text>
